blocks.en:
This routine transforms unstructured facts of a contested transaction in natural language into structured inputs of the Catala model.
The factual-extraction routine uses an LLM to extract eight structured case inputs from the target case:
three boolean inputs ( is legal act , performed by the debtor , and for no consideration );
two dates (the date of the legal act and bankruptcy date );
and three textual explanations supporting the extracted boolean values.

blocks.zh:
这一常规将自然语言中有争议的交易的非结构化事实转化为Catala模型的结构化投入.
事实提取常规使用LLM从目标案例中提取8个结构化案例输入:
三种布尔输入(是法律行为,由债务人实施,不作考虑);
两种日期(法令的日期和破产日期);
和支持提取布尔值的三种文字解释。
